# PantryPal Configuration
# 
# The OpenAI API key is stored securely on-device via the app's Settings/Scan Invoice screen.
# You do NOT need a .env file for the app to work.
#
# However, if you want to set a default key for development:
# 1. Copy this file to .env
# 2. Fill in your OpenAI API key below
#
# Get your key from: https://platform.openai.com/api-keys
# Recommended: Use a key with usage limits set for safety

OPENAI_API_KEY=sk-your-api-key-here
